### 1. Health Check Request
# Expected status: 200 OK
GET http://localhost:3001/api/health

### 2. Collection GET (Fetch all equipment)
# Expected status: 200 OK
GET http://localhost:3001/api/items

### 3. Found Item GET (Fetch item ID 1)
# Expected status: 200 OK
GET http://localhost:3001/api/items/1

### 4. Missing Item GET (Fetch non-existent ID 999)
# Expected status: 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:3001/api/items/999

### 5. Invalid-ID Item GET (Fetch with non-numeric ID 'abc')
# Expected status: 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:3001/api/items/abc

### 6. Valid POST Request (Create new equipment item)
# Expected status: 201 Created
POST http://localhost:3001/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "4K Studio Camera",
  "category": "Video",
  "location": "Studio B",
  "condition": "Excellent",
  "dailyPrice": 35,
  "available": true
}

### 7. Invalid POST Request (Missing required fields)
# Expected status: 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:3001/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Incomplete Camera"
}

### 8. Valid PATCH Request (Update availability for item 1)
# Expected status: 200 OK
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "available": false
}

### 9. Invalid PATCH Request (Sending unknown field)
# Expected status: 400 Bad Request
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unknownField": "Hack Attempt"
}

### 10. PATCH Request for Missing Item
# Expected status: 404 Not Found
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/items/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "available": false
}

### 11. Successful DELETE Request (Delete item 1)
# Expected status: 200 OK
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/items/1

### 12. DELETE Request for Missing Item
# Expected status: 404 Not Found
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/items/999

### 13. Unmatched Endpoint Request
# Expected status: 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:3001/api/unknown-route